    title: "Gigolo",
    description: Some("You steer a woman around a neighbourhood of twelve houses, memorising which seven the men slipped into after leaving the jail. Draw cash from the teller, then call on an occupied house to score — but a wrong or repeated door, or an empty wallet, leaves you open to the police, and holding too much money draws a mugger after you. Each bust costs one of your limited turns."),
